    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Presented in walk-in condition, this bright and spacious three-bedroom semi-detached family home enjoys a quiet cul-de-sac setting within the popular Raithín Eoghain development, just minutes from Mullingar town centre. Offering generous accommodation, modern finishes and an excellent location close to schools, shops and everyday amenities, this superb home is ideal for first-time buyers or young families.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall with tiled flooring, leading to a spacious sitting room centred around a solid fuel stove. To the rear, the modern kitchen and dining area is fitted with an excellent range of wall and floor units, quartz worktops, tiled splashbacks and generous dining space. A separate utility room provides additional storage and a guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a generous primary bedroom with fitted wardrobes and en-suite. The remaining bedrooms are bright and spacious, with fitted wardrobes in the second bedroom, while the fully tiled family bathroom is finished to a high standard with an electric shower.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from ample off-street parking, a private rear patio area, side access, a timber garden shed, exterior lighting, outdoor sockets and an exterior tap.\n\nRaithín Eoghain is a well-established development conveniently located within walking distance of Mullingar town centre, Tesco Shopping Centre, a wide range of sporting and recreational amenities. The nearby Ring Road, N52 and N4 motorway provide excellent connectivity for commuters.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Hall 1.89m x 4.9m (6'2\" x 16'1\"): \nTiled, wired for alarm.\n\nSitting Room 3.51m x 5.33m (11'6\" x 17'6\"): \nCarpet floor, solid fuel stove.\n\nKitchen/Dining 3.87m x 4.91m (12'8\" x 16'1\"): \nTiled floor, fitted kitchen, extractor fan, tiled splashback, storage, quartz countertop.\n\nUtility Room 1.63m x 3.5m (5'4\" x 11'6\"): \nTiled, fitted cupboards, plumbed for washing machine.\n\nGuest WC 1.56m x 1.55m (5'1\" x 5'1\"): \nTiled floor, WC, wash hand basin, tiled splashback.\n\nLanding \nCarpet.\n\nBathroom 2.53m x 2.81m (8'4\" x 9'3\"): \nTiled floor, WC, wash hand basin, Triton T90 electric shower, tiled wall, wall mounted mirror with light.\n\nBedroom One 4.36m x 3.37m (14'4\" x 11'1\"): \nCarpet floor, double room, fitted wardrobes, thermostat, rear aspect.\n\nEn-Suite 1.23m x 2.53m (4' x 8'4\"): \nTiled, WC, wash hand basin, Triton T90 electric shower, wall mounted mirror, tiled splashback.\n\nBedroom Two 4m x 3.15m (13'1\" x 10'4\"): \nCarpet, fitted wardrobes, front aspect.\n\nBedroom Three 2.8m x 2.86m (9'2\" x 9'5\"): \nCarpet, single room, front aspect.\n\nBER \nBER B, \nBER No. 119665545\n\nSpecial Features & Services\n•Three-bedroom semi-detached home \n•Quiet cul-de-sac location \n•Spacious kitchen and dining area \n•Separate utility room & Guest WC \n•Fitted wardrobes in two bedrooms \n•Gas-fired central heating \n•New boiler installed in 2023 \n•Ample off-street parking \n•Private rear patio area \n•Side access \n•Timber garden shed \n•Exterior lighting \n•Exterior tap and outdoor sockets \n•Alarm system \n•Walking distance to Mullingar town centre \n•Close to Tesco Shopping Centre \n•Close to schools and all local amenities \n•Easy access to the Ring Road, N52 and N4 motorway \n•Ideal first-time buyer or family home\n\nIncluded\n•Fixtures & fittings\n•Curtain poles, Blinds & Some curtains\n•Dishwasher\n•Fridge freezer\n•Dryer/Washing machine\n•Oven & Stove"
      },
